---
// The site has one theme, light, with the terminal always dark (identity.css,
// Demo.astro). Starlight renders <html data-theme="dark"> and its own
// ThemeProvider picks a theme from a saved choice or the system; this one sets
// light before the first paint, so Starlight's light values apply.
---

<script is:inline>document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "light";</script>
